[
{
"k": "3187",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Tell you what I told Toad..."
},
{
"k": "3188",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Don't be a pain in the ass."
},
{
"k": "3189",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "I'll tell you what I told Toad."
},
{
"k": "3190",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "And what's that?"
},
{
"k": "3191",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "I can't give you a free pass."
},
{
"k": "3192",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Get a glamour or go up to The Farm.  It's not complicated."
},
{
"k": "3193",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "You're putting all of Fabletown at risk."
},
{
"k": "3194",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Nothing. [beat] Because he  knows better... [under his breath] probably."
},
{
"k": "3195",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Lectured by the Big Bad Wolf.  He must have loved that."
},
{
"k": "3196",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Exactly. You know I'm right."
},
{
"k": "3197",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "The fresh air and sunshine pitch they sell you on is bullshit. I didn't escape out of the Homelands to end up in some prison, okay.  Don't send me back there, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "3198",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "That for me?"
},
{
"k": "3199",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "The house didn't blow itself down, Bigby. That's all I'm sayin'. Do with that, what you will. [pause] Now I'm not saying it's reason enough for me to have definitely been offered a drink, but uh... it would have helped ease some of the pain you once caused me, yes. It also would have shown everyone how different you are now."
},
{
"k": "3200",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Everyone hates me?"
},
{
"k": "3201",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "[casually concerned] I'm doing my best here."
},
{
"k": "3202",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "[casually curious] So... everyone hates me?"
},
{
"k": "3203",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Better to be feared..."
},
{
"k": "3204",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "...eating alone."
},
{
"k": "3205",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "It is better to be feared, than loved. You know who said that?"
},
{
"k": "3206",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Yeah... some sad asshole..."
},
{
"k": "3207",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "I was just hungry."
},
{
"k": "3208",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "But you would, if you could."
},
{
"k": "3209",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Probably."
},
{
"k": "3210",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "It wasn't murder... I was hungry."
},
{
"k": "3211",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Yeah, well I'm hungry now. You don't see me tearing the flesh off your bones."
},
{
"k": "3212",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "It probably also has something to do with how engaging you are in conversation."
},
{
"k": "3213",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "I thought we were all supposed to  have a fresh start here."
},
{
"k": "3214",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "I can't change the past."
},
{
"k": "3215",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "I was doing my job, believe it or not."
},
{
"k": "3216",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Sometimes I take them to The Farm."
},
{
"k": "3217",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Wasn't my fault."
},
{
"k": "3218",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Don't need advice."
},
{
"k": "3219",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "I don't need advice from a pig right now."
},
{
"k": "3220",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Not everyone."
},
{
"k": "3221",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "By being big, and being bad."
},
{
"k": "3222",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "\"By being big, and being baaaad.\" Don't say that shit in front of people, it's embarrassing."
},
{
"k": "3223",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "This is your problem. You can't have a normal relationship with anyone because of all this bullshit you're carrying around."
},
{
"k": "3224",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "You think my job is easy?  You try keeping a bunch of Fables from killing each other. How do you think this all works?"
},
{
"k": "3225",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "There was a girl..."
},
{
"k": "3226",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Faith."
},
{
"k": "3227",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Her name is Faith."
},
{
"k": "3228",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "I don't actually know her name."
},
{
"k": "3229",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Beauty."
},
{
"k": "3230",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Beast."
},
{
"k": "3231",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Oh yeah?"
},
{
"k": "3232",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "I agreed to help him find out if his wife is cheating on him."
},
{
"k": "3233",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "...isn't there some sort confidentiality rules for people when they walk into your office?"
},
{
"k": "3234",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "If there isn't, there probably should be."
},
{
"k": "3235",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Toad."
},
{
"k": "3236",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "He was yelling at them."
},
{
"k": "3237",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Eh, sounds about right."
},
{
"k": "3238",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "You don't know."
},
{
"k": "3239",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "You don't know what you're talking about."
},
{
"k": "3240",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Wait, when?"
},
{
"k": "3241",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "What're you bringing up Snow for anyway?"
},
{
"k": "3242",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "What?  How do you know?"
},
{
"k": "3243",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Colin's Here"
},
{
"k": "3244",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Colin's here, but I guess you already knew tha--"
},
{
"k": "3245",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Phone's off the hook."
},
{
"k": "3246",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Sorry Snow, the phone was off the hook and--"
},
{
"k": "3247",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Want a drink?"
},
{
"k": "3248",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "You want a drink?"
},
