"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Snow?"
},
{
"k": "3382",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "I still don't understand."
},
{
"k": "3383",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "But Miss Livia, we can't reveal ourselves to the Mundys!  It's against the law."
},
{
"k": "3384",
"who": "LIVIA",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "It's a silly law, written to protect us against superstitious mortal puritans.  The Mundys of today are far more enlightened than-"
},
{
"k": "3385",
"who": "LIVIA",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Well, if Clorinda had any, I certainly didn't know about them.  Aside from the Adversary, of couse... but then, he's everyone's enemy, isn't he?"
},
{
"k": "3386",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Bigby. Please tell me you have better news than Miss White had to offer."
},
{
"k": "3387",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "--and now you tell me there's a killer on the loose?"
},
{
"k": "3388",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "And what books of the thousands that are surrounding me, are you referring to, Miss Snow?"
},
{
"k": "3389",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{angrya}Bufkin!"
},
{
"k": "3390",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Hello, Miss Snow."
},
{
"k": "3391",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
