},
{
"k": "3393",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{angrya}Then don't you think it probably belongs to him?"
},
{
"k": "3394",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Maybe."
},
{
"k": "3395",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "How are you today, Mr Bigby?"
},
{
"k": "3396",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "I'm not great."
},
{
"k": "3397",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Fuck off, Bufkin."
},
{
"k": "3398",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Fine, Bufkin. Thanks for asking."
},
{
"k": "3399",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Not your fault. Thanks for asking though."
},
{
"k": "3400",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{thinkinga}Well,  we should probably start there."
},
{
"k": "3401",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "We?"
},
{
"k": "3402",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{normala}Yeah. I'm coming with you."
},
{
"k": "3403",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Let me find it...  one minute..."
},
{
"k": "3404",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "I found her."
},
{
"k": "3405",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "It's your job to [emphasis] keep the peace.  Do it better."
},
{
"k": "3406",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "[phone processing] Bigby!  Shit.  Listen, right? There's a bloke upstairs, going through all the Woodsman's things.  I told him to fuck off, and he put his hands on me, man.  Get over here, Bigby! Before he-- wait. Hang on."
},
{
"k": "3407",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "It spilled into the street, but it wasn't an issue. No reports were filed."
},
{
"k": "3408",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "The Mundy police were called to the scene?"
},
{
"k": "3409",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "[shocked] What?"
},
{
"k": "3410",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Yeah yeah yeah.  It's fine."
},
{
"k": "3411",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "It hasn't been a good day, Bufkin."
},
{
"k": "3412",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Okay, I'll call a cab."
},
{
"k": "3413",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "I can take care of myself."
},
{
"k": "3414",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "You, of all people, shouldn't use that phrase."
},
{
"k": "3415",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "He's all bark."
},
{
"k": "3416",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{annoyeda}{body-sita}You accuse me of improprieties that are as {angrya}insulting as they are false, {thinkinga}and now you tell me there's {angrya}a killer on the loose? {confuseda}How is it that a woman of such, {creepya}beauty, such grace {angrya}could be this incomp- {surpriseda}...{suspiciousa}mm, Bigby, {thinkinga}please tell me you have better news than {annoyeda}Miss White had to offer... {angrya}and I don't want to hear any of this stuff and nonsense about Bluebeard {annoyeda}because I know for certain that he's out of the country at the moment. {creepya}Do we have a suspect, any leads?  {annoyeda}This is a big case! And you need to produce results or we'll find someone who can. It's about expediency and discrestion Bigby... you'll get whoever it is, quickly and quietly. You've already got a mess in your lap sheriff... figure that one out, before making new ones. Ahm, hm, ah right, we'll finish this up later. There are good, hardworking fables in this community that want to KNOW that their town is safe, so, er um, wait... who else, knows about this? For your sake I'm going to assume that means no one. Good... good. We need.. we'll keep this under wraps good That's the best approach for now. We can't have a panic breaking out. I want this killer caught sheriff. That is the only thing you and snow should be concerned with. This happened on your watch don't forget that! So do your job sheriff... or we'll get someone who can."
},
{
"k": "3417",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "[sighs, then hams it up] Donkeyskin girl, A.K.A. Donkeyskin, [laughs] A.K.A. Ass' skin, [laughs harder] prefers to go by the name Faith. Wow, wonder why?"
},
{
"k": "3418",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "[still hams it] The story of Donkeyskin. There once was great king with a beautiful queen. The queen grew ill and had her husband promise to only marry the most beautiful girl in the kingdom. After a long search, it became clear that the only woman in the land that could match her beauty was…"
},
{
"k": "3419",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "…his daughter …Faith. She had a magic cloak made from the skin of her father's prized donkey… that would hide her beauty, so she could escape his kingdom. Eventually she married a prince, who could see past the magic cloak and knew her true beauty… and they lived happily ever after."
},
{
"k": "3420",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Should I… mark it, Miss White?"
},
{
"k": "3421",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{sada}What did you do with her?"
},
{
"k": "3422",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "[awkward] I took her to Dr Swineheart. He said he'd have some information in a few hours."
},
{
"k": "3423",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{sada}Okay... [sad] {sadb}poor thing."
},
{
"k": "3424",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{flustereda}Drinking this early? {angrya}{body-hips}Where did you get that?"
},
{
"k": "3425",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "It was by Mr. Ichabod's desk."
},
{
"k": "3426",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "[beat] Maybe."
},
{
"k": "3427",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Not your fault. Thanks for asking, though."
},
{
"k": "3428",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "It hasn't been a great morning, Bufkin."
},
{
"k": "3429",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Stay here?"
},
{
"k": "3430",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{angryb}No..."
},
{
"k": "3431",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Shouldn't you stay here?"
},
{
"k": "3432",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Okay. But make sure you stay close."
},
{
"k": "3433",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{thinkinga}Stay close. Right, {normala}then let's go soon."
},
{
"k": "3434",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "It's too dangerous."
},
{
"k": "3435",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{sarcastica}I can take care of myself just fine, Bigby. {thinkinga}Besides..."
},
{
"k": "3436",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Snow, there's a killer on the loose. It's too dangerous."
},
{
"k": "3437",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{normala}Good. {happya}It's settled then."
},
{
"k": "3438",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Then let's go. {angrya}I'd like to get out of here before he shows up."
},
{
"k": "3439",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "He's got a massage appointment this afternoon and he's usually in a better mood after then... I'd rather catch him in th-"
},
{
"k": "3440",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "I'd prefer not to get yelled at by Crane this early... but if he showed up, I don't think I'd be able to keep it from him."
},
{
"k": "3441",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "[sad, hesitant] Good... morning, Mr Ichabod."
},
{
"k": "3442",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "[happy] Good morning, Mr Ichabod."
},
{
"k": "3443",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "What kind of incident?"
},
{
"k": "3444",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Snow... Bigby. You're in early."
},
{
"k": "3445",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "A little morning research?"
},
{
"k": "3446",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "I heard sirens last night. Very late... and quite close. Do either of you know anything about this?"
},
{
"k": "3447",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{worrieda}Well, Sir... there was... {flustereda}an incident."
},
{
"k": "3448",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "A woman was killed."
},
{
"k": "3449",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "[sudden realization] Oh... her."
},
{
"k": "3450",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "[very specific inflection, as in, what were you going to say, why did you react that way] What?"
},
{
"k": "3451",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "[hurried] Nothing. [adding this to deflate the tension] I just think I've seen her before."
},
{
"k": "3452",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "What? Who?"
},
{
"k": "3453",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "I'm not familiar."
},
{
"k": "3454",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "A woman was... killed."
},
{
"k": "3455",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{thinkingb}Donkey-skin girl."
},
{
"k": "3456",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "I got into a fight."
},
{
"k": "3457",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Suppose not."
},
{
"k": "3458",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "I was in a fight... with the Woodsman."
},
{
"k": "3459",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Some things never change, do they?"
},
{
"k": "3460",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Looking for the Woodsman."
},
{
"k": "3461",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "We're currently searching for the Woodsman."
},
{
"k": "3462",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "What for?"
},
{
"k": "3463",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Assault."
},
{
"k": "3464",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "He was drunk and got rough with a girl. I got in his face, and he came after me. He ended up slipping off when the cop showed up."
},
{
"k": "3465",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "I'll find him and throw him in the tank 'til he sobers up."
},
{
"k": "3466",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "[shakes his head] How a man who was once so heroic, could fall so far, is beyond me."
},
{
"k": "3467",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{sada}It happens more than you think."
},
{
"k": "3468",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Murder."
},
{
"k": "3469",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "I think he was involved in a murder."
},
{
"k": "3470",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "[irritate Crane]"
},
{
"k": "3471",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "He's a person of interest in an investigation."
},
{
"k": "3472",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "What's the investigation about?"
},
{
"k": "3473",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Stuff."
},
{
"k": "3474",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "What kind of stuff, Bigby?"
},
{
"k": "3475",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Sheriff stuff. It's under control."
},
{
"k": "3476",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "[pedantic, condescending] I know you have history with the Woodsman."
},
{
"k": "3477",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{worrieda}He may have been involved in a murder."
},
{
"k": "3478",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{worrieda}There's been a murder."
},
{
"k": "3479",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "What?  Sheriff, is this true?"
},
{
"k": "3480",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{worrieda}Well..."
},
{
"k": "3481",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{thinkingb}how should I put this..."
},
{
"k": "3482",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{worriedA}Uh..."
},
{
"k": "3483",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Sheriff, I'm counting on you to rectify this situation. It is imperative that you find whoever did this. Our Mayor is away, the Mundy world encroaches ever further onto your doorstep despite our spells and now we have killer on the loose? We are under siege, Bigby. This needs to be handled quickly and quietly."
},
{
"k": "3484",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "A girl died last night."
},
{
"k": "3485",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Yes. I know."
},
{
"k": "3486",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "You didn't mention it. Thought I should. It's what's important to me."
},
{
"k": "3487",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "[calming] {happya}It is, Mr Crane. {normala}I assure you."
},
{
"k": "3488",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Do you jobs. Or we'll find someone who can."
},
{
"k": "3489",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "I appreciate your bringing this to my attention, Bigby. That said, you should  really  let bygones be bygones and drop your vendetta against the Woodsman. Fate has dealt him more punishment than you ever could."
},
{
"k": "3490",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "We'll see about that."
},
{
"k": "3491",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Yeah... we'll see about that."
},
{
"k": "3492",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Leave the Woodsman alone, Mr Wolf."
},
{
"k": "3493",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "It's your job to [emphasis]keep the peace. Do it better."
},
{
"k": "3494",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Just doing my job."
},
{
"k": "3495",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Alright, well, that's good to hear."
},
{
"k": "3496",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "I'll  interpret your silence as an affirmative. I've learned over the last hundred years to take what I can get."
},
{
"k": "3497",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "And so."
},
{
"k": "3498",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "There, there, Sheriff.  I know my corrections may smart..."
},
{
"k": "3499",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "But I never inflicted a chastisement without following it by the assurance: That you will remember it and thank me for it the longest day you live."
},
{
"k": "3500",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "Where have I heard that before?"
},
{
"k": "3501",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{normala}I'll see you out, Sheriff."
},
{
"k": "3502",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_businessoffice",
"en": "{angrya}Sorry, I have to get that."
}
]